[[Blueberries]] are a [[Food]] available in the shop for all characters, at rare rarity. [[Blueberries]] can be helpful with generating {{icon/mana}} and {{icon/luck}}, due to its size, and it's effects can be very helpful in configuring builds which focus on {{icon/luck}} or {{icon/mana}} (though there are [[Mana Orb|more efficient methods]] to generate {{icon/mana}} in particular).

